  "acceptanceRules": [
    "all five L4WO-05 slots must have reviewed evidence packets before L4 aggregate calibrated review can open",
    "each attached report packet must include redacted SHA-256 artifact hashes and human reviewer roles",
    "calibration diagnostics must be tied to a specific prediction horizon and outcome definition",
    "TRIPOD+AI reporting completeness must be explicitly checked before any reporting packet can close",
    "PROBAST+AI or PROBAST-style risk of bias and applicability review must be explicitly checked before any reporting packet can close",
